A.2.35. {"problem": "The domain's declared contents changed, but `version` stays at 10 and the domain is still wired in at interface 1. Authoring's handoff targets interface `1.x`. The change is not recorded as a new version, so consumers and the change check cannot tell it apart from the earlier declaration.", "where": "delivery/delivery.domain.yaml, version; toprope-self.composition.yaml, members.delivery", "kind": "other", "from": "llm"}
